{"dog":{"age_group":"adult","application_url":"https://www.nycacc.org/adopt/adoption-process/","availability_detail":"available","breed_display":"Domestic Short Hair Cross","breed_primary":"Domestic Short Hair Cross","description_text":"My foster writes: Panther is a sweet, relaxed guy who seems like he's had wilder days behind him and is ready to settle down. He is pretty content on his own but likes some pets on his head when he's relaxing. In the evening, he knows how to entertain himself with toys when he wants to.\nHe is a litter box champion and a very deep sleeper whose favorite sleeping position is \"perfect black ball,\" although sometimes on closer inspection you'll notice that his head is actually facing up! He's got sweet round green eyes. Overall, Panther is a gentle soul who just wants to take it easy. He doesn't require much other that a comfy place to lay his head! He loves all food and treats.\n\nWith more time in the foster home, Panther has shown himself to be a sometimes-chatty cat who loves human companionship and affection. He takes all cheek scratches as invitations to lay down belly up and roll over a couple times, and he will follow you around at times! Panther is a bit dog-like - he even tolerates belly rubs, although cheek scratches are his favorite.","detail_url":"https://nycaccpets.shelterbuddy.com/animal/animalDetails.asp?s=adoption&searchTypeId=4&animalType=2%2C15&pagesize=75&task=view&tpage=6&searchType=4&animalid=198337","id":"0d02a412a8a2325c65cc8a67c5feacad","image_urls":["https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/73fd994ed65347979f6e4cb04ed68955-1778699397-1778699412-jpg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/ad930861b4c54cc39086245f64bf266e-1778699397-1778699397-jpg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/e2590fc2ebfe4d488e031859e4a7f347-1778699396-1778699396-jpg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/0904a3d592cb4e3b972ba47d7f6bd0be-1778699396-1778699396-jpg/600---n","https:/